'''Hivange''' ({{IPA|fr|ivɑ̃ʒ}}; {{Langx|lb|Héiweng}}; {{Langx|de|Hivingen}} {{IPA|de|ˈhiːvɪŋən|}}) is a village in the [[Communes of Luxembourg|commune]] of [[Garnich]], in western [[Luxembourg]].  {{As of|2026|09}}, the village has a population of 140.<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://data.public.lu/fr/datasets/registre-national-des-personnes-physiques-rnpp-population-par-localite-population-per-locality/ |title=Registre national des personnes physiques RNPP : Population par localité |date=30 September 2026 |access-date=11 October 2026 |website=data.public.lu}}</ref>  Nearby is the [[source (river or stream)|source]] of the [[Mamer River|Mamer]].

